    "options": {
      "A": "The smallest angle is $40^{\\circ}$ and the order is $9$, because $360^{\\circ}\\div 9=40^{\\circ}$.",
      "B": "The smallest angle is $40^{\\circ}$ even when the nine parts are not equal.",
      "C": "The smallest angle is $360^{\\circ}\\times 9=3240^{\\circ}$ and the order is $9$.",
      "D": "Line symmetry of the badge alone settles the smallest rotation angle and the order."
    },
